| `rosters.readmes` | list of strings | the ten README.md paths keel's rosters live in: `agents/`, `agents/tools/`, `docs/adr/keel/`, `docs/guides/`, `docs/reference/`, `evals/`, `mcp/`, `models/`, `scripts/` and `scripts/jobs/` | repo-relative paths to existing `README.md` files, each once | check_S | Names the READMEs check_S holds to their directories; a listed README without `## What ships here`, a listed path with no file and a README carrying the heading that is not listed are errors, and an absent block lists nothing, so every roster README errors. | what a roster contains: the README's own `## What ships here` table | always |
